WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.051
When a bug has several plausible causes,

2
00:00:03.051 --> 00:00:06.960
start with one command that
catches the symptom every time.

3
00:00:07.967 --> 00:00:11.846
With slash debug, Pi exercises
the actual greeting command.

4
00:00:11.846 --> 00:00:15.659
It captures the bad output,
checks how the name is chosen,

5
00:00:15.659 --> 00:00:19.407
and makes the flag separate
from the positional argument.

6
00:00:29.933 --> 00:00:32.386
Then Pi runs the original check again.

7
00:00:32.386 --> 00:00:35.613
You can keep that same test
as a regression check.
